      "writtenOn": "2019-12-02T22:40:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it make sense to generate the attachment ID from some immutable attachment attributes? Say mac addres, pppoe session ID, etc? Would there be any benefit? E.g. support for free for duplicate detection where two attachments have the same mac address / pppoe session ID. Just wondering if you gave it any thought.",
